1
00:00:00,604 --> 00:00:02,404
(Sheldon:)Oh.

2
00:00:02,405 --> 00:00:04,905
(Leonard:)Well, you know, just...
(sniffs)

3
00:00:04,908 --> 00:00:07,638
(Leonard:)being myself, really.

4
00:00:07,644 --> 00:00:08,574
Oh, please!

5
00:00:08,578 --> 00:00:10,248
(Sheldon:)You know, I'll tell you
how he did it.

6
00:00:10,246 --> 00:00:12,946
(Sheldon:)Implacable,
relentless badgering.

7
00:00:14,217 --> 00:00:16,047
(Sheldon:)In urology terms,

8
00:00:16,052 --> 00:00:18,782
(Sheldon:)he was a drug-resistant
staph infection.

9
00:00:18,788 --> 00:00:22,658
(Sheldon:)And she was a urethra
that could not shake him.

10
00:00:24,661 --> 00:00:28,431
(Leonard:)I don't know that I'd call
myself an infection.

11
00:00:28,431 --> 00:00:30,501
(Howard:)A gallant man would
defend his fiancée

12
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,470
(Howard:)for being called a urethra.

13
00:00:32,469 --> 00:00:35,899
(Leonard:)Can we please
change the subject?

14
00:00:35,905 --> 00:00:37,005
(Amy:)Hi.

15
00:00:37,007 --> 00:00:39,077
(Raj:)Well, that didn't
go your way.

16
00:00:41,111 --> 00:00:44,141
(Penny:)Dr. Lorvis,
what are you doing here?

17
00:00:44,147 --> 00:00:47,017
(Dr Lorvis:)Uh, well, actually
I came to see you.

18
00:00:47,017 --> 00:00:48,517
(Penny:)Really? Why?

19
00:00:48,518 --> 00:00:51,618
(Leonard:)Ah, that's a good question.

20
00:00:51,621 --> 00:00:54,691
(Leonard:)Apparently someone was
being awfully flirty

21
00:00:54,691 --> 00:00:56,261
(Leonard:)while not wearing
their engagement ring,

22
00:00:56,259 --> 00:00:57,629
(Leonard:)causing another
someone to show up

23
00:00:57,627 --> 00:00:59,627
(Leonard:)here thinking the first
someone might be available.

